        "jp": "そもそもなんだ貴様は。\r\nぞろぞろと手下をつれてやってきて。\r\n誇りというものがないのか？",
        "official_en": "Bringing a pack of underlings? Where is your pride as a warrior? Have you no shame?",
        "real_en": "And who do you think you are, bringing a whole pack of underlings along? Don't you have any pride?"
      },
