      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "少女よ。\r\nお前には真実を見抜く目があるようだな。\r\nそこの男とは違って。",
        "official_en": "I am impressed, child. Your perceptiveness and wisdom put your acquaintance to shame.",
        "real_en": "Girl, you seem to have an eye for the truth. Unlike that man over there."
